{"unit_id":"huanglianqi__dsh-math-render#card-zh","repo":"huanglianqi/dsh-math-render","commit":"588e13d75e34f725ea62340ad3d7221f90292cf9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-math-render 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的数学公式渲染插件，可在用户自己的聊天消息中把 LaTeX 公式显示为数学排版，并在输入草稿中实时预览公式。它向用户文本解析注册公式识别规则，并将公式节点交给 DSH 自带的 MarkdownText 渲染；同时在输入区上方注册草稿预览条。支持美元符号和反斜杠分隔符，代码片段中的内容保持原样。适合需要在对话中书写数学表达式并在发送前检查排版的网页用户。安装后需使用支持相应用户文本规则和界面插槽的 DSH 版本，无需额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:248-294","client.js:298-330","client.js:409-444"]}
{"unit_id":"huanglianqi__dsh-math-render#card-en","repo":"huanglianqi/dsh-math-render","commit":"588e13d75e34f725ea62340ad3d7221f90292cf9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-math-render renders LaTeX in DSH web chat messages and previews formulas in the composer. It registers a user-text rule and preview strip, using DSH's MarkdownText renderer. Code spans stay literal. It helps users write equations in chat; it needs compatible DSH, with no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:248-294","client.js:298-330","client.js:409-444"]}
