{"unit_id":"huanglianqi__dsh-math-render#feature-1","repo":"huanglianqi/dsh-math-render","commit":"588e13d75e34f725ea62340ad3d7221f90292cf9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-math-render 的功能「消息公式排版」：把用户消息中的 LaTeX 片段交给 DSH 的 MarkdownText 渲染。发送包含公式的消息后，行内或独立公式会在聊天气泡中显示为排版结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:258-294"]}
{"unit_id":"huanglianqi__dsh-math-render#feature-2","repo":"huanglianqi/dsh-math-render","commit":"588e13d75e34f725ea62340ad3d7221f90292cf9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-math-render 的功能「草稿公式预览」：在输入草稿包含 LaTeX 时，于输入框上方显示实时预览条；编辑草稿会更新预览，没有公式时预览条不渲染。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:298-330"]}
{"unit_id":"huanglianqi__dsh-math-render#feature-3","repo":"huanglianqi/dsh-math-render","commit":"588e13d75e34f725ea62340ad3d7221f90292cf9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-math-render 的功能「保护代码和普通文本」：识别公式时跳过反引号包裹的代码、转义美元符号和符合金额形式的文本，避免这些内容被当作数学公式。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:89-107","client.js:143-183"]}
